<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JULY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.82 BILLION.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JULY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.82 BILLION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Friday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 5.82 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for July 29		     9,500</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for July	     6,520</p>
<p> Average reserves to July 24			  6,726</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5,824</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
